# The database snapshot is committed and MUST reach the function bundle - the API
# cannot start without it. Listed explicitly so no future ignore rule strips it.
!data/pmvl-snapshot.db
# The deploy checks the artefact against this; shipping one without the other
# means the check silently degrades to "no manifest found".
!data/pmvl-snapshot.manifest.json

